stormnic-ixgbe
==============

An original Rust implementation, licensed MIT (see LICENSE).

Acknowledgement: the hardware facts in docs/spec/ (register layouts, bit
fields, constants and programming sequences) were learned from Intel's
datasheets and Intel's ixgbe shared code (FreeBSD sys/dev/ixgbe/, BSD-3-Clause,
commit 669cd0d90ee7). No source code was copied; the driver is a rewrite, and
docs/spec/ describes the hardware in its own words.
